OL,3,AFiring squad execution to be
OL,4,Alivestreamed, Pentagon says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe public will be able to watch the
OL,7,Fexecution of a former US Army major by
OL,8,Ffiring squad, US Defence Secretary Pete
OL,9,FHegseth has said.
OL,11,FA Defence Department official told the
OL,12,FBBC the execution of Nidal Hasan, who
OL,13,Ffatally shot 13 unarmed US soldiers at
OL,14,Fthe Fort Hood military base in 2009,
OL,15,Fwould be livestreamed.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
